{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Uninvoiced\">Uninvoiced</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Billable_expenses Billable_time BillableExpense BillableExpenses BillableTime Expenses Invoice Invoiced Is Sales SalesInvoice Uninvoiced\">The Uninvoiced screen displays all <em>billable time</em> and <em>billable expenses</em> that have been recorded but not yet included in a sales invoice.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer Expenses Is To ToDate\">This screen helps you track unbilled work and expenses for a specific customer.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Sales SalesInvoice\">Creating a Sales Invoice</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create From FromDate Invoice Invoiced Item Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate Uninvoiced\">To create a sales invoice from uninvoiced items:</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Item Next Select To ToDate\">1. Select the items you want to include by checking the boxes next to them</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice NewSalesInvoice On Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate\">2. Click the <strong>New Sales Invoice</strong> button at the bottom of the screen</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Automatic Invoice Item Rate Sales SalesInvoice Select To ToDate\">3. The system will automatically generate a sales invoice with the selected items</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is\">Understanding the Display</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount And Current Date Description Import Invoice Invoiced Item On Port Rent Status Uninvoiced\">Each row shows important details about the uninvoiced item, including the date, description, amount, and current status.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Invoiced Item Uninvoiced\">Items marked as <em>Uninvoiced</em> in red indicate they are available for billing.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Date\">Date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Billable_time BillableExpense BillableTime Date Is\">Displays the date when the <em>billable time</em> was worked or the <em>billable expense</em> was incurred.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Date Description Invoice Invoiced Is Item Line LineDescription On\">This date will be included in the line description when the item is invoiced.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Billable_time BillableExpense BillableTime Description On\">Shows the description entered for the <em>billable time</em> entry or <em>billable expense</em>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer Description Invoice Is Item Line On Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate\">This description will appear on the sales invoice line item to help the customer understand what they are being charged for.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Custom Customer Is Item To ToDate\">Displays the amount that will be charged to the customer for each item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Billable_time BillableTime By HourlyRate Hours Is Rate\">For <em>billable time</em>, this is calculated as the hourly rate multiplied by the hours worked.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Billable_expenses BillableExpense BillableExpenses Expenses Is\">For <em>billable expenses</em>, this shows the expense amount that was marked as billable.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Is Item To ToDate Total\">The total at the bottom shows the sum of all displayed items.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Status\">Status</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Status\">Status</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Current Item Rent Status\">Shows the current billing status of each item.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Invoiced Is Item Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate Uninvoiced\">Items displayed as <em>Uninvoiced</em> (in red) are ready to be included in a sales invoice.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Invoice Invoiced Is Item On\">Once items are invoiced, they will no longer appear on this screen.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "new-sales-invoice-form"
}
